  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></semantics></math> có tập xác định là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>ℝ</mi></semantics></math>.</li><li>Hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hàm số chẵn nên hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></semantics></math>  là hàm số chẵn.</li><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>≤</mo><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math> hay <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy giá trị lớn nhất của hàm số đã cho là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>13</mn></semantics></math>.</li><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>π</mi><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℤ</mi></mrow></semantics></math>).<br>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>97</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>. Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mi>…</mi><mo>;</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>16</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></semantics></math> có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>17</mn></semantics></math> nghiệm trên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
